The shpx binary, when built from this workspace, links against the third-party
software listed below. Each entry summarizes the upstream project, the license
under which shpx redistributes (or links to) it, and where in shpx the
dependency is used. License texts for crates pulled in by Cargo can be inspected
with `cargo license` or in each crate's source tree under
`~/.cargo/registry/src/`. The C / C++ libraries that shpx vendors via build
scripts (libspatialite, libgeos, libproj) ship their own LICENSE / COPYING
files inside the relevant `vendor/` directories.

Driver-scope details for the libspatialite vendor tree (tarball provenance,
removed paths, distribution implications under LGPL 2.1) live in
`crates/shpx-driver-spatialite/NOTICE`.

================================================================================
C / C++ libraries linked when `bundled-spatialite` / `bundled-proj` features
================================================================================

## libspatialite 5.1.0

  Upstream:   https://www.gaia-gis.it/gaia-sins/
  License:    triple-licensed under MPL 1.1 / GPL 2.0 / LGPL 2.1
              (see crates/shpx-driver-spatialite/vendor/libspatialite-5.1.0/COPYING)
  Used by:    shpx-driver-spatialite (when `bundled-spatialite` feature is on)
  Notes:      vendored in-tree under
              crates/shpx-driver-spatialite/vendor/libspatialite-5.1.0/.
              Statically linked via build.rs + cc.
              See crates/shpx-driver-spatialite/NOTICE for distribution
              implications under the LGPL 2.1 option.

## libgeos (GEOS)

  Upstream:   https://libgeos.org/
  License:    LGPL 2.1
  Used by:    shpx-driver-spatialite (transitively, via geos-src 0.2 when
              `bundled-spatialite` feature is on)
  Notes:      compiled from source by the `geos-src` build script (CMake +
              C++ stdlib). Not vendored directly by shpx; the version is
              determined by `geos-src 0.2`.

## libproj (PROJ)

  Upstream:   https://proj.org/
  License:    X/MIT (BSD-style)
  Used by:    shpx-geom (when `bundled-proj` feature is on; implied by
              `bundled-spatialite` on the CLI)
  Notes:      compiled from source by `proj-sys` (via the `proj` crate's
              `bundled_proj` feature). License text ships inside the proj-sys
              vendor tree.

## SQLite

  Upstream:   https://www.sqlite.org/
  License:    Public Domain
  Used by:    shpx-driver-gpkg, shpx-driver-spatialite (always; via the
              `rusqlite/bundled` feature regardless of the spatialite bundle).
  Notes:      compiled from source by the `libsqlite3-sys` crate.

================================================================================
Rust crates (selected direct dependencies)
================================================================================

The following crates are direct dependencies declared in `Cargo.toml` and form
the public-facing data path of shpx (geometry I/O, RDBMS clients, format
codecs). License values are the SPDX expressions declared by each crate's
upstream `Cargo.toml`. Indirect / transitive dependencies are not enumerated
here; consult `cargo tree` and `cargo license` for the full list.

## Apache Arrow / Parquet

  Crates:     arrow, arrow-array, arrow-schema, parquet (54.x)
  License:    Apache-2.0
  Used by:    every driver (shpx schema I/O), parquet driver (GeoParquet codec)

## tokio / tokio-postgres / postgres-types

  Crates:     tokio, tokio-postgres, postgres-types, tokio-util
  License:    MIT
  Used by:    shpx-driver-postgis (PostgreSQL/PostGIS client), shpx-driver-sqlserver

## tiberius

  Crates:     tiberius (0.12)
  License:    MIT OR Apache-2.0
  Used by:    shpx-driver-sqlserver (SQL Server / Azure SQL client)

## flatgeobuf / geozero

  Crates:     flatgeobuf (6.0), geozero (0.15)
  License:    BSD-2-Clause (flatgeobuf) / MIT OR Apache-2.0 (geozero)
  Used by:    shpx-driver-fgb (FlatGeobuf reader/writer)

## shapefile

  Crates:     shapefile (0.6)
  License:    MIT
  Used by:    shpx-driver-shp (Shapefile reader/writer)

## geojson

  Crates:     geojson (0.24)
  License:    MIT OR Apache-2.0
  Used by:    shpx-driver-geojson (FeatureCollection / NDJSON reader/writer)

## proj

  Crates:     proj (0.28), proj-sys
  License:    MIT
  Used by:    shpx-geom (Reprojector)

## rusqlite

  Crates:     rusqlite (0.31, with `bundled` SQLite)
  License:    MIT
  Used by:    shpx-driver-gpkg, shpx-driver-spatialite

## Workspace-wide utility crates

  Crates:     chrono, regex, encoding_rs, clap, thiserror, serde, serde_json,
              inventory, bytes, futures-util, rust_decimal, uuid, tracing,
              tracing-subscriber
  License:    MIT OR Apache-2.0 (see upstream crate metadata)
  Used by:    CLI / schema / error / logging / JSON / decimal glue.

